  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-9995 2nd Biennial Transparency Report (BTR 2) and the combined 6th National Communication and 3rd BTR (BTR2 + BTR3/6NC) -Namibia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As laid out in the Convention, signatory countries are obligated to report to the Conference of the Parties on steps taken to implement the Convention. Parties must prepare and submit Biennial Transparency Reports (BTR) every 2 years. Biennial Transparency Report can be combined with a National Communication (BTR/NC) if the timeline of the two reports coincide. Accordingly, Namibia is in the completion phase of its BTR1/NC5 for submission in December 2024, and this project aims at enabling Namib</narrative>
  </description>
